    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i have these really bad migraines all the time... but i just got the most intense headache ever. like it hit me like a bolt of lightning out of nowhere. it's the worst pain i've ever felt but i think it might just be a really bad migraine flare up?? i dont really want to go to the er if i can help it, it's such a hassle. what do u think?",
