      "role": "user",
      "content": "helppp i'm just really scared to go to the hospital and spend all that money if it's just a migraine. honestly it's already starting to feel a bit like my usual ones after that initial shock. if i just take a double dose of the sumatriptan and sleep it off, i'll probably be fine by morning right? it's just a really intense version of what i'm used to. i really need to just know it's okay to stay home.",
